														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3789259">
									

<p>This is interesting. I'm not sure I fully grasp the context of why the D-class is in a situation that has Foundation personnel treating him like a patient, but there's enough info given to justify the emotion we're seeing. Also, the whole concept of a person who's not used to having personal autonomy no longer wanting that autonomy because freedom is scary and unknown is a concept I like seeing explored in the Foundation universe. I've experienced the real-life parallels personally, so it always strikes a chord for me.</p>

							</div>

								
					
