			<div class="content" id="post-content-3789463">
									

<p>Absolutely love this. A far more sensical depiction of D-class than ye olde logistically impossible death row squad. I once owned a dog who did the same thing once, so that ending hit me like a truck. The tiny little moment of asking for a coke and getting a pepsi to symbolize the disconnect between the two was also just understated brilliance. I'd upvote this twice if I could.</p>

